    "name": "S&P Capital IQ API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The S&P Capital IQ API provides programmatic access to comprehensive global financial data including fundamental financials, valuations, pricing, credit ratings, capital structure, and reference data. All requests use Bearer token authentication with tokens valid for 3600 seconds. Communication uses HTTPS on port 443 with 256-bit encryption.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: S&P Global Market Intelligence Support",
